<title>USA: Triarc Companies names John Barnes CFO.</title>
<headline>Triarc Companies names John Barnes CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Triarc Cos Inc said Thursday John Barnes has assumed the position of chief financial officer, following the recent retirement of Joseph Levato.</p>
<p>Prior to joining Triarc, Barnes was executive vice president and chief financial officer of Graniteville, Triarc's former textile subsidiary, which was sold during the 1996 second fiscal quarter.</p>
<p>Levato will continue as a member of Triarc's board.</p>
</text>
